{"3714920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Shed", "steam_appid": 3714920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/0f6fce42669fb8a6694674d917278ac1.poster.avif?t=1760296606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/0f6fce42669fb8a6694674d917278ac1.webm?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/2da3c12f8451e23c8f595f14666ec48d.poster.avif?t=1760296606\" width=748 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/2da3c12f8451e23c8f595f14666ec48d.webm?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/2da3c12f8451e23c8f595f14666ec48d.mp4?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shed</strong> is a narrative driven mystery game that unfolds in the confines of a forgotten garden and its long abandoned outbuilding. Left behind by people you never knew, this place is both inheritance and enigma weathered, quiet, and humming with a past that won't stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/5898712cb1f6ee22b2715237e5e97e47.poster.avif?t=1760296606\" width=746 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/5898712cb1f6ee22b2715237e5e97e47.webm?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/5898712cb1f6ee22b2715237e5e97e47.mp4?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Shed, your surroundings will transform dramatically as the story unfolds. The garden will shift through different states, revealing new atmospheres and hidden faces. What begins as a single place grows into a journey across multiple environments, making every stage feel fresh and alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/fd1938a1334ad6280cbc2b31fa4d6d23.poster.avif?t=1760296606\" width=746 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/fd1938a1334ad6280cbc2b31fa4d6d23.webm?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/fd1938a1334ad6280cbc2b31fa4d6d23.mp4?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the overgrown corners and rusted walls, you'll uncover more than just memories. Dialogue unfolds through a worn command-line interface, and every decision has a weight. Actions ripple across timelines, subtly shifting the world around you. Sometimes, the garden is not what it seems briefly slipping into another form, another perspective just long enough to say something it couldn’t otherwise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/652721f00ac22dff8d4ac47e84cf0d9c.poster.avif?t=1760296606\" width=748 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/652721f00ac22dff8d4ac47e84cf0d9c.webm?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/652721f00ac22dff8d4ac47e84cf0d9c.mp4?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on atmosphere, emotional storytelling, and quiet discovery, <i>The Shed</i> invites you to trace the lines between memory, consequence, and identity all from one small patch of earth where time doesn't always move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision has been made, might cause an impact on weather, safety or maybe even time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/afed786c6801d95cc34112f5e67b8642.poster.avif?t=1760296606\" width=748 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/afed786c6801d95cc34112f5e67b8642.webm?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/afed786c6801d95cc34112f5e67b8642.mp4?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><strong>TIMELINE</strong><br>As you play through The Shed, you will uncover the game’s timeline. This timeline will appear in your menu to help you follow the chain of events throughout the story. Every important moment or ‘memory imprint’ will be marked there.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/f7a453eebb80431b3c2a3e41d52a7ee1.poster.avif?t=1760296606\" width=746 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/f7a453eebb80431b3c2a3e41d52a7ee1.webm?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/f7a453eebb80431b3c2a3e41d52a7ee1.mp4?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><strong>INTERACTIVITY</strong><br>Explore our garden’s dynamic and interactive elements. We designed the environment to be both atmospheric and engaging, enhancing the overall quality of your gameplay experience.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/d3eb334b021c66e0e1c3bfe2ce8272b6.poster.avif?t=1760296606\" width=746 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/d3eb334b021c66e0e1c3bfe2ce8272b6.webm?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/d3eb334b021c66e0e1c3bfe2ce8272b6.mp4?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/e82537bfcf7ffde48f4cc0f7a93f9d95.poster.avif?t=1760296606\" width=746 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/e82537bfcf7ffde48f4cc0f7a93f9d95.webm?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714920/extras/e82537bfcf7ffde48f4cc0f7a93f9d95.mp4?t=1760296606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poste